OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant plans set to be refused
OL,4,Afor third time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former seaside restaurant should not
OL,7,Fbe converted into a holiday home,
OL,8,Fplanning officials have ruled.
OL,10,FIt was the third time the owners of
OL,11,FNude Dunes at La Pulente have tried to
OL,12,Fchange the use of the building after
OL,13,Fthe restaurant closed unexpectedly in
OL,14,FNovember 2023.
OL,16,FPrevious plans for the site in Jersey's
OL,17,FSt Ouen's Bay were rejected in 2024 and
OL,18,F2025 due to concerns about the
OL,19,Fpotential impact on the landscape.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
