OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant plans set to be refused
OL,4,Afor third time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest proposal was to convert the
OL,7,Fbuilding into a two-bedroom holiday let
OL,8,Fwith a cafe attached, but a planning
OL,9,Fofficer said it was essentially the
OL,10,Fsame concept to previous versions and
OL,11,Frecommended it be refused.
